<title>USA: Northwest Airlines names Lawrence CFO.</title>
<headline>Northwest Airlines names Lawrence CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwest Airlines Corp said Thursday it had named James Lawrence, former president and chief executive of Pepsi-Cola Co Asia, Middle East, Africa, as its new chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Lawrence will oversee Northwest's corporate finance and strategic planning activities, as well its fuel and aircraft purchasing subsidiaries, the company said.</p>
<p>As part of his appointment at Northwest, Lawrence will immediately resign from the board of Trans World Airlines Inc, Northwest said.</p>
</text>
